    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i feel like im just performing a role every single day and i'm so tired. like no matter how much i try to act normal or fit into the groups around me, it just feels like im playing a character in a play i never auditioned for. it's just exhausting.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
