    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's more than just being tired though. it's like... knowing that no matter how much i \"let down the act,\" i'll still be fundamentally wrong for this world. like there's no version of me that actually fits. it just feels like i'm wasting my time trying to bridge a gap that can't be bridged.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
